   "textLength": 470,
   "text": "After the infamous Signal chat debacle, which contributed to President Donald Trump’s decision to oust him as national security adviser, Waltz was sent to serve as the U.S. ambassador to the United Nations. Instead of hiding at the struggling global institution in New York, Waltz has seized chances to stay in the spotlight, from hosting hip-hop royalty to warning Cuba’s leaders to “change your way",
